OL,3,AWhy high energy bills look like they
OL,4,Aare here to stay
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnergy bills may have been a long way
OL,7,Ffrom our minds through the sweltering
OL,8,Fsummer.
OL,10,FClothes on a washing line have been
OL,11,Fdrying in minutes. Cold showers have
OL,12,Fbeen more tempting than hot ones.
OL,14,FBut the latest news and forecasts on
OL,15,Fgas prices will bring a renewed sense
OL,16,Fof worry and urgency to families, as
OL,17,Fwell as government ministers.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
