OL,3,AWhy high energy bills look like they
OL,4,Aare here to stay
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnergy prices will rise by nearly 4%
OL,7,Ffor millions of households in October.
OL,8,FEven more striking is a prediction from
OL,9,Fthe respected consultancy Cornwall
OL,10,FInsight of a further 9% increase at the
OL,11,Fpeak of winter in January.
